{"id":"n55492-1-8","stage":4,"title":"모욕 · 侮辱","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55492-1-8-1","ko":"넌 어떻게 이렇게 쉬운 것도 못하니?","zh":"你怎么连这么简单的事情都做不好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬운","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하니?","meaning":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","explanation":"못하다：做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易，简单","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"做起来不累或不难。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/36c15aaec1fbf1df6fc3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55492-1-8-2","ko":"지금 그 말은 나에 대한 모욕이야.","zh":"你现在说的话是在侮辱我啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말은","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나에","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모욕이야.","meaning":"侮辱，羞辱","explanation":"모욕：侮辱，羞辱；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"모욕","audio":"/audio/3df4c6fca5d4fc57fc33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55492","senseId":"1","lemma":"모욕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"3df4c6fca5d4fc57","term":"모욕","zh":"侮辱，羞辱","audio":"/audio/3df4c6fca5d4fc57fc33.mp3","entryId":"55492","definition":"小瞧对方，使其丢人、不光彩。","pronunciation":["모ː욕"]}],"audio":"/audio/01f1fe0858678d081af9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.977,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55492","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.8037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你怎么连这么简单的事情都做不好？","你现在说的话是在侮辱我啊。","妈妈，有股焦味。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么连这么简单的事情都做不好？","你现在说的话是在侮辱我啊。","妈妈，有股焦味。"],"answer":1}]}
